%!PS
% FLIP: PDF/A-2b prefix for Ghostscript's pdfwrite. Written for FLIP from the pdfmark and PDF/A rules.
% It embeds one sRGB output intent. The token @ICC_PROFILE@ is replaced by the engine with the profile path.
% The colour conversion strategy is always RGB, so the profile has exactly 3 components.
[/_objdef {flip_icc} /type /stream /OBJ pdfmark
[{flip_icc} << /N 3 >> /PUT pdfmark
[{flip_icc} (@ICC_PROFILE@) (r) file /PUT pdfmark
[/_objdef {flip_oi} /type /dict /OBJ pdfmark
[{flip_oi} <<
  /Type /OutputIntent
  /S /GTS_PDFA1
  /DestOutputProfile {flip_icc}
  /OutputConditionIdentifier (sRGB)
>> /PUT pdfmark
[{Catalog} << /OutputIntents [ {flip_oi} ] >> /PUT pdfmark
